        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoo olaiguanani Mordekai enkanyit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te ina kewarie neitu eirura olaiguanani; neitanapisho ninye pee eyauni embuku natii mbaa naadamuni, neisumi te dukuya olaiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.2.21+EST.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 2.21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Netumi eigero ajo etolimuo Mordekai Bigtana o Teres, lelo oare ti atua isunaishi oogelema lo laiguanani, apa oorripito kutuk aji, neyieu sii apa nepik nkaik enye olaiguanani Serser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olaiguanani, “Amaa kaa anyit anaa kaa kitoo eishooki Mordekai tena bae?” Nejoki ilaisiaayiak lo laiguanani ooisiaita ninye, “Meetae enaitaasaki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo olaiguanani, “Aing'ae otii olodung'oro, naa enalotunye Haman atua ilo odung'oro li oriong enkaji o laiguanani, pee etum airorie olaiguanani pee eiki Mordekai te nchumata ilo shani ogorishoreki oitobiraka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neliki ilaisiaayiak lo laiguanani ninye, ejo, Etii Haman idie, eitashe to lodung'oro.” Nejo olaiguanani, “Enchoo elotu atua aji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejing'u Haman atua aji, nejoki olaiguanani ninye, “Kaa eitaasi oltung'ani oshipakino olaiguanani pee eyanyit.” Nejo Haman to ltau lenye, Kaing'ae pasa oitishipa olaiguanani pee eyanyit aitalang nanu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Haman ajoki olaiguanani, “Ore oltung'ani oshipakino olaiguanani pee eyanyit ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inchoo eyauni nkilani e nkitoo naaidipa olaiguanani aishopo, o ina barta naidipa olaiguanani atakedo, neishopokoki olmarisian le nkitoo endukuya enye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neishori nena kilani o ina barta eitarasakini obo loo laitasheikinok lo laiguanani oata enkitoo; nchoo ninye eishopoki ilo tung'ani oshipakino olaiguanani pee eyanyit, nerikoo ninye ekedito embarta te nkoitoi sapuk e ina ang, eitayiolo aibalunye te dukuya ninye nchere, neijia eikoni ilo tung'ani oshipakinoolaiguanani pee eyanyit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani ajoki Haman, “Isarisara intayu nena kilani o ina barta, ore anaa enitejo, nintaas ina Mordekai ilo Yahudi otonita te nkishomi o laiguanani. Mintong'or ake nabo te nena duoo nitejo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu Haman inkilani o embarta neishopoki Mordekai neisho ninye metakedo embarta nerikoo ninye aimie ilo kurroto otumoreki le nkanasa eibalunye ajo, “Inji eikoni oltung'ani oshipakino olaiguanani pee eyanyit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Mordekai ashuko alo kishomi o laiguanani. Kake eisarisara Haman alo enkaji enye eishirita neimulumula elukunya enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neliki Haman enkitok enye Seresh o lchoreta lenyena pooki nena baa pooki naanoto ninye. Nejoki ninye ilang'eni lenyena o enkitok enye Seresh, “Tenaa ko Lyahudi Mordekai ilo apa litang'asa adumakino mindim naa iyie ninye kake meeta nchere mibatata iyie te dukuya ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etaaraki Haman metua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eton eirorie ninche ninye, nebau lelo sunaishi oogelema lo laiguanani eisosion pee eya Haman ilo sirua oitobira Esta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
